# Deny by default. Only files required by Dockerfile.test and its lifecycle
# smoke test are allowed into the build context. Local .env files, credentials,
# keys, logs, backups, caches, Git metadata, editor state, and temporary
# artifacts remain outside Docker build inputs and image layers.
**
!Dockerfile.test
!install.sh
!uninstall.sh

!bin/
!bin/**

!git/
!git/config

!shell/
!shell/**

!tests/
!tests/container-smoke.sh

!.githooks/
!.githooks/pre-commit
